    "data": "<h1>Biliboard术力口周榜</h1><p>创刊于2024年6月12日，继承自日本Billboard周榜，收录包括但不限于使用VOCALOID、UTAU、SynthesizerV、CEVIO、初音ミクNT等音声合成引擎制作的歌曲（统称“术曲”），旨在针对B站的流行趋势对术曲排名，并传播日本虚拟歌姬文化。</p><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img class=\"cut-off-6\" alt=\"cut-off-6\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/article/02db465212d3c374a43c60fa2625cc1caeaab796.png\"/></figure><h1>排名计算方式</h1><p>0、数据统计周期为上周周二12点至本周周二12点</p><p>1、时间修正</p><p>t = LOG(EXP(DATE([投稿日期])-DATE([最近一期周榜的发布时间的前一天]))/14 + 1)+1</p><p>2、得分计算</p><p>播放基数 = 新增播放 * 时间修正</p><p>得分 = 播放基数 + 新增收藏 * 30 + 新增点赞 * 3 + 新增硬币 * 10 + (投票比值 + 100%) * 播放基数</p><p>投票&amp;提名网站: https://aquarite.uk</p><p>排名并不完全等同于歌曲质量，请理性看待！</p><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img class=\"cut-off-5\" alt=\"cut-off-5\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/article/4adb9255ada5b97061e610b682b8636764fe50ed.png\"/></figure><h1>第 20 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1cHMjzQEAo/\" target=\"_blank\">光芒四射</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/1af694d7a14363398d0633c215d7a0fc3546800279522160.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1>第 19 名 - 奇迹犬大游行</h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/9a088ace2091f762f122c02e173b8abd3546800279522160.jpg\" width=\"438\" height=\"294\" data-size=\"126220\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><p><strong>第 18 名 - </strong><a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1sDJtzDEMN/\" target=\"_blank\">仿真花束</a><br/></p><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/cefbbc1d982a50f3fd11127150f52f2648dca89d.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1>第 17 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1A4jMzREkq/\" target=\"_blank\">静电干扰</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/e60c83313f4a3a6fc5ccf6c94c1d7eb03546800279522160.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1>第 16 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15oTuzDEPm/\" target=\"_blank\">毕竟你来了不唱也不行是吧?</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/f66cdef842feac79a2fcbb58c0c9c7753546800279522160.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1>第 15 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1vqQUYYEmg/\" target=\"_blank\">超级超级超级超级超级讨厌</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/6bd5a9fba79b1471d73e8c533ffbab653546800279522160.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1>第 14 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13e7PztEGd/\" target=\"_blank\">回复还没好吗？大叔式发言！</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/0dad0173ab6f3da5463d0015dad4f8d03546800279522160.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1>第 13 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1217Sz2Ecj/\" target=\"_blank\">欢欢乐乐安乐死</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/c0744e709690bb2b531c0d6687cad3ac3546800279522160.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1>第 12 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1rqMwz5EWt/\" target=\"_blank\">蛋糕</a></h1><p><br/></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/a9db5c74606c0e4316af8c86c3fa7eef3546800279522160.jpg\"/><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"false\"></figcaption></figure><h1>第 11 名 - 